"""AQS-TST-002 ZNBR2 stack test plan and physics prediction (X-MFG-41, A-M-179). Prediction: voltage efficiency
(E - j ASR)/(E + j ASR) with E = 1.82 V [SAND2000-0893] at j = 20 mA/cm2 [ZBFB_REVIEW2023]; coulombic efficiency 1 - HER share
(HER 0.055 mL/h/cm2 at 20 mA/cm2 as 2 e- per H2 [ZBFB_REVIEW2023]) - crossover; auxiliaries off the top. The design round trip
(storage_round_trip) is held at its value until the test reports. Run: python3 docs-authority/_znbr_test.py"""
import json, os, sys
R = os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))); sys.path.insert(0, R)
from flow_graph.param import drivers as DR
d = DR.load(); v = lambda k: DR.val(d, k)
E = v('znbr_cell_V'); j = v('znbr_j_mA_cm2')/1000; eta = j*v('znbr_ASR_ohm_cm2')
VE = (E - eta)/(E + eta)
her = v('znbr_her_mL_h_cm2')/1000/24.465*2*96485/3600/j                       # fraction of charge current, 25 C molar volume
CE = 1 - her - v('znbr_crossover_loss'); RT = VE*CE*(1 - v('znbr_aux_frac'))
md = ['# ZNBR2 stack test', '', 'Document number: AQS-TST-002', 'Revision: A', 'Date: 2026-10-16', 'Authority: AQS-PLAN-007 X-MFG-41. Generated by `docs-authority/_znbr_test.py`. A-M-179. Replaces the battery-vendor basis of A-M-062.', '',
      '## 1. Prediction', '',
      f"Voltage efficiency (1.82 - {eta:.3f})/(1.82 + {eta:.3f}) = {VE:.3f} at 20 mA/cm2 and {v('znbr_ASR_ohm_cm2')} ohm cm2 (SAND2000-0893, ZBFB_REVIEW2023; ASR assumed). Coulombic efficiency 1 - HER {her:.4f} - crossover {v('znbr_crossover_loss')} = {CE:.3f}. Auxiliaries {v('znbr_aux_frac')*100:.0f} %. Predicted round trip {RT:.3f}. The design value stays {v('storage_round_trip')} until the test; the gap ({(RT - v('storage_round_trip'))*100:.0f} points) is margin, not credit.", '',
      '## 2. Article', '', 'One in-house 10-cell stack built to the ZNBR2 cell design (same electrode, separator, flow frame and current density), 0.1 m2 per cell, with its own electrolyte loop and Br2 complexing agent.', '',
      '## 3. Procedure', '',
      '1. Leak and hydrostatic test of the flow frames at 1.5 x pump shut-off pressure.',
      '2. Formation: three charges at 10 mA/cm2 to 50 % zinc loading.',
      '3. Polarisation: charge and discharge at 5, 10, 20, 30 and 40 mA/cm2 at 50 % state of charge; cell voltages logged at 1 Hz; ASR from the slope.',
      '4. Daily cycle: 30 cycles of 6 h charge at 20 mA/cm2 and discharge over the 14 h night at the matching current, 25 C and 40 C electrolyte.',
      '5. Self-discharge: 24 h open circuit at full charge; coulombs lost and H2 collected in a gas burette.',
      '6. Strip cycle: full zinc strip every 5 cycles, as the plant will run it.',
      '7. Auxiliaries: pump and controller power logged over the cycles.', '',
      '## 4. Measurements and acceptance', '',
      '| Quantity | Method | Prediction | Feeds |', '|---|---|---|---|',
      f"| ASR | polarisation slope | {v('znbr_ASR_ohm_cm2')} ohm cm2 | znbr_ASR_ohm_cm2 |",
      f"| Coulombic efficiency | Ah out / Ah in per cycle | {CE:.3f} | znbr_crossover_loss |",
      f"| H2 evolution | gas burette, charge and open circuit | {v('znbr_her_mL_h_cm2')} and {v('znbr_oc_corr_mL_h_cm2')} mL/h/cm2 | znbr_her_mL_h_cm2, ZNBR2 purge |",
      f"| Round trip | Wh out / Wh in including pumps, mean of cycles 11-30 | {RT:.3f} | storage_round_trip |",
      '| Derate | capacity fade over 30 cycles extrapolated to 20 years with strip cycling | none assumed | ZNBR2 kWh |', '',
      'Acceptance: the measured round trip replaces storage_round_trip and the plant re-sizes PV and storage through the pipeline. A round trip below 0.65 or fade above 1 % per 30 cycles is a design review.']
open(os.path.join(R, 'docs-authority/ZNBR2_STACK_TEST.md'), 'w').write('\n'.join(md) + '\n'); print(json.dumps(dict(VE=VE, CE=CE, RT=RT, her=her)))
